    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With HERETIC ASTARTES as your Army Faction, you can take KHORNE BERZERKERS, RUBRIC MARINES, PLAGUE MARINES and NOISE MARINES as allies. Give them HERETIC ASTARTES in place of their original Faction keywords. The swaps remove WORLD EATERS from Berzerkers, THOUSAND SONS from Rubrics, DEATH GUARD from Plague Marines and EMPEROR’S CHILDREN from Noise Marines. Their combined allowance by battle size is 250 points at Incursion, 500 at Strike Force and 750 at Onslaught.",
